  "translation": "On Sunday, I went to the supermarket with my mom. We bought fruit and milk. Mom asked: “What fruit can you eat?” I said: “I can eat apples.” Mom bought three apples. Then we went to a bookstore. I bought two books, one Chinese book and one English book. That book is very nice-looking. Mom didn't buy a book because she was very tired. We drank coffee in the bookstore. I drank a cup of coffee, and Mom drank a cup of tasty tea. We all feel very happy today, and I am happy too."
